  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>&#955;</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>&#955;</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mi>&#955;</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math> be three vectors such that <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math> and <math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math> is perpendicular to <math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>.</mo></math> Then a possible value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mi>&#955;</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mrow><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#955;</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><msub><mi>&#955;</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced></math> is",
    "image": null
  },
